&lt;h3&gt;


3. React Canvas Component (Next.js Integration)
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here we build our Next.js client component. It renders the node-based canvas, manages WebSocket connectivity, validates incoming structured payloads, and drives user interactions.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
